{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24532","headline":"寄题庐山旧草堂兼呈二林寺道侣 · 白居易","name":"寄题庐山旧草堂兼呈二林寺道侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年前草堂主，而今虽在鬓如丝。\n登山寻水应无力，不似江州司马时。\n渐伏酒魔休放醉，犹残口业未抛诗。\n君行过到鑪峰下，爲报东林长老知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}